00:17:02.515 --> 00:17:04.752
Stan. you're beginning to depress me.

240
00:17:04.915 --> 00:17:09.258
Oh. well.
maybe you'll feel just a little better after this.

241
00:17:09.492 --> 00:17:11.827
Easy. Easy. And hold.

242
00:17:12.404 --> 00:17:15.307
Oh. that's a fair trade.
A cotton ball for all my blood.

243
00:17:15.445 --> 00:17:17.901
OK. Ricky. all finished.

244
00:17:19.766 --> 00:17:22.898
Hey. I'm really looking forward
to this bachelor party.

245
00:17:23.062 --> 00:17:27.984
Whatever you do. you don't say nothin'
to Tina. OK? She'll kill me.

246
00:17:28.375 --> 00:17:30.480
- Who don't you say nothin' to?
- Tina?

247
00:17:30.647 --> 00:17:32.174
Tina. OK.

248
00:17:32.376 --> 00:17:35.475
Don't screw me up.
I told her I'm going to a plasma convention.

249
00:17:35.640 --> 00:17:38.061
Oh. well. that's brilliant.

250
00:17:38.296 --> 00:17:39.671
Hi. Tina!

251
00:17:40.633 --> 00:17:45.042
Rick! Mr Goldsmith. this is my brother-in-law.
He's getting married.

252
00:17:45.817 --> 00:17:47.312
Congratulations.

253
00:17:48.314 --> 00:17:49.624
Nurse. take over.

254
00:17:49.818 --> 00:17:52.121
I am so happy for you!

255
00:17:52.379 --> 00:17:54.419
That's great. I'm glad. Thanks.

256
00:17:54.619 --> 00:17:59.060
Listen. I gotta run. I gotta make sure
the guys have got the hookers!

257
00:18:00.188 --> 00:18:02.196
- Hookers?
- He didn't say hookers.

258
00:18:02.332 --> 00:18:05.202
- Did I say hookers? I didn't mean...
- You said hookers.

259
00:18:05.308 --> 00:18:08.026
He didn't say hookers. I'm walking Ricky out.

260
00:18:08.670 --> 00:18:12.631
You had to open your mouth. You had to
say something. You had to say hookers!

261
00:18:12.733 --> 00:18:16.411
- Doc. I'll pay my bill! Don't hurt me. please!
- I'll kill you!

262
00:18:18.943 --> 00:18:21.943
I'll pull out your lights! I'll rip out your guts!

263
00:18:22.079 --> 00:18:25.625
I'll break you in half!
Now shut up and get outta here!

264
00:18:25.792 --> 00:18:27.734
OK. All right.

265
00:18:28.064 --> 00:18:30.301
Oh. listen. I'll see ya Saturday for the...?

266
00:18:30.433 --> 00:18:32.407
Out!

267
00:18:37.634 --> 00:18:39.969
Mrs Phillips. You're next.

268
00:18:52.741 --> 00:18:55.293
- OK. who serves?
- Your turn. Dad.

269
00:19:12.103 --> 00:19:15.103
It's long. it's to the fence.
it's to the wall! It's gone!

270
00:19:15.272 --> 00:19:16.449
- Rick!
- Yep.

271
00:19:16.840 --> 00:19:19.491
Hit the ball easier. son.
You don't have to kill it.

272
00:19:19.881 --> 00:19:22.499
Uh... maybe we should go in now.

273
00:19:22.665 --> 00:19:25.600
No. We will at least finish this set.

274
00:19:30.858 --> 00:19:32.800
- Ready?
- Yo!

275
00:19:40.556 --> 00:19:42.597
Yes! Cleveland wins the pennant!

276
00:19:46.700 --> 00:19:51.688
One of these days. I'm gonna burn the
Thompson court right to the ground.

277
00:19:55.150 --> 00:20:00.268
I gotta admit my tennis is a little rusty.
but polo... There's a game. eh?

278
00:20:00.430 --> 00:20:03.430
Unrelenting.
constant challenge to the senses.

279
00:20:03.536 --> 00:20:05.837
A beautiful. manly experience.

280
00:20:05.999 --> 00:20:09.830
Rick. I want to cut through the BS.

281
00:20:11.184 --> 00:20:13.289
- I'd like that.
- Good.

282
00:20:13.936 --> 00:20:16.174
I think you're an asshole.

283
00:20:16.337 --> 00:20:19.720
No. let me correct that. An immature asshole.

284
00:20:20.018 --> 00:20:23.434
Which is fine. except that
you're marrying my daughter

285
00:20:23.666 --> 00:20:27.496
and I'm afraid that my grandchildren
are gonna be little assholes.

286
00:20:27.570 --> 00:20:29.742
- Mr Thompson. I...
- No. let me finish.

287
00:20:30.035 --> 00:20:33.035
Debbie is an adult.
She can do what she wants.

288
00:20:33.813 --> 00:20:38.188
But if you want your marriage to last. you
have to change some things about yourself.

289
00:20:38.517 --> 00:20:42.031
