448
00:31:51.518 --> 00:31:56.025
Now I want this to be a surprise for
the groom. so you never saw me. OK?

449
00:31:57.086 --> 00:31:59.029
No problem.

450
00:32:19.201 --> 00:32:21.374
Move it out. move it out. move it out!

451
00:32:25.218 --> 00:32:28.121
You be careful with that bus. It's a rental.

452
00:32:30.596 --> 00:32:32.189
Was I kidding? Was I kidding?

453
00:32:32.388 --> 00:32:34.624
We who are about to go apeshit salute you!

454
00:32:34.755 --> 00:32:36.698
We want women!

455
00:32:39.813 --> 00:32:41.788
Hold it! Hold it!

456
00:32:42.245 --> 00:32:45.147
Before we move on. I have a little surprise.

457
00:32:47.238 --> 00:32:49.856
I have flown in someone dear to all of us.

458
00:32:50.087 --> 00:32:52.705
A man who has traveled over 3.000 miles.

459
00:32:52.871 --> 00:32:54.846
Come on. Rick. let's go.

460
00:32:54.952 --> 00:32:58.596
A man whom none of us have seen
since he left town.

461
00:33:00.872 --> 00:33:02.214
Come on. come on!

462
00:33:02.377 --> 00:33:04.930
A man whom we affectionately
call Peckerhead!

463
00:33:05.096 --> 00:33:07.486
Oh. my God. our dad is here.

464
00:33:07.657 --> 00:33:10.024
It's your childhood chum and mine.
Brad Mollen!

465
00:33:10.314 --> 00:33:11.077
Brad!

466
00:33:11.274 --> 00:33:13.641
<i>That Peckerhead! Where is he?</i>

467
00:33:18.891 --> 00:33:19.839
Guys!

468
00:33:20.460 --> 00:33:21.441
Guys!

469
00:33:21.579 --> 00:33:23.522
Guys! Guys!

470
00:33:24.556 --> 00:33:27.753
For the last time. I'm telling you
to get off of there!

471
00:33:28.557 --> 00:33:30.215
Off! Off!

472
00:33:30.413 --> 00:33:31.525
OK!

473
00:33:35.021 --> 00:33:36.298
Guys!

474
00:33:37.038 --> 00:33:38.980
Holy shit!

475
00:33:40.079 --> 00:33:41.322
Dr Stan!

476
00:33:41.454 --> 00:33:42.981
Hi. Brad.

477
00:33:43.151 --> 00:33:45.736
Rick! Oh. Rick! Rick!

478
00:33:46.735 --> 00:33:48.677
Jay!

479
00:33:49.872 --> 00:33:50.952
Rudy!

480
00:33:51.503 --> 00:33:52.878
